1
00:00:03,050 --> 00:00:04,446
Nuggo: Brickley! I have solved mornings!

2
00:00:04,856 --> 00:00:06,939
Brickley: It's three in the afternoon.

3
00:00:07,349 --> 00:00:09,340
Nuggo: Exactly! I slept right through the problem.

4
00:00:10,669 --> 00:00:11,276
Nuggo: Behold!

5
00:00:12,485 --> 00:00:13,438
Nuggo: The Snooze-O-Matic!

6
00:00:13,847 --> 00:00:16,281
Nuggo: It hits snooze for you, so you never have to wake up!

7
00:00:16,690 --> 00:00:18,951
Brickley: So it's a box that makes you late.

8
00:00:19,360 --> 00:00:20,225
Nuggo: Efficiently late!

9
00:00:21,554 --> 00:00:22,223
Nuggo: Watch this!

10
00:00:25,032 --> 00:00:25,733
Nuggo: Ha! It works!

11
00:00:27,293 --> 00:00:28,806
Nuggo: Phase one... a total success.

12
00:00:30,535 --> 00:00:32,160
Brickley: Does it have an off switch?

13
00:00:32,570 --> 00:00:33,851
Nuggo: Off switches are for quitters!

14
00:00:37,680 --> 00:00:38,815
Nuggo: See? Now it's well rested.

15
00:00:39,525 --> 00:00:42,346
Brickley: Subscribe, before he invents breakfast.

16
00:00:45,906 --> 00:00:47,003
Brickley: Phase one.
